    {"id": "run-tests.sh:1533", "line": 1533, "kind": "t", "desc": "reconstructed need 过 validate（含扫描基线附加节）", "prelude": [{"kind": "chunk", "line": 1496, "text": "sed -i.bak 's/^TRACKER=.*/TRACKER=local/' \"$TMP/.sdlc/config.sh\" && rm -f \"$TMP/.sdlc/config.sh.bak\"\n\necho \"== reconstructed 状态（逆向产物零改动兼容）==\""}, {"kind": "new_repo", "line": 1499}, {"kind": "chunk", "line": 1500, "text": "wfile docs/needs/0001-legacy-rules.md <<'EOF'\n---\nid: 0001\nstatus: reconstructed\ncreated: 2026-10-29\n---\n# 逆向：结账业务规则\n\n## 背景与业务目标\n存量结账模块的业务规则沉淀（证据：src/checkout/order.py:12）。\n\n## 干系人与用户\n买家与客服。\n\n## 系统能力需求\n- FR-1 结账须校验库存（证据：src/checkout/order.py:31）\n- FR-2 优惠码叠加上限为一层（证据：src/checkout/coupon.py:8，低置信：仅单处证据）\n\n## 场景\n- Given 库存不足 When 结算 Then 拒绝订单\n\n## 假设与风险\n- 规则自代码逆向，未经产品确认\n\n## 范围与非目标\n不含模块内部实现细节。\n\n## 开放问题\n- 叠加上限是否为产品意图\n\n## 扫描基线\ncommit：abc1234def；日期：2026-10-29；已覆盖：src/checkout/；未覆盖：src/billing/（未覆盖区不得读成不存在）。\nEOF"}], "want": 0, "cmd": "check.sh validate docs/needs/0001-legacy-rules.md", "cmd_raw": "\"check.sh validate docs/needs/0001-legacy-rules.md\"", "substr": "通过"},
    {"id": "run-tests.sh:1571", "line": 1571, "kind": "t", "desc": "reconstructed spec 覆盖齐过 validate", "prelude": [{"kind": "chunk", "line": 1534, "text": "wfile docs/specs/0001-legacy-behavior.md <<'EOF'\n---\nid: 0001\nstatus: reconstructed\nneed: 0001\nround: 1\ncreated: 2026-10-29\n---\n# 逆向：结账系统行为\n\n## 问题陈述\n结账模块行为无文档沉淀。\n\n## 方案\n以逆向 spec 沉淀系统行为与模块职责，断言带证据。\n\n## 用户故事\n- 作为新会话 agent，我想读沉淀物即可了解结账行为，以便不重复全量扫描\n\n## 实现决策\n行为断言句末带 文件:行 证据引用。\n\n## 测试决策\n证据可回溯抽查，不做机械校验。\n\n## 验收场景\n- [FR-1 | 工单级] Given 库存不足 When 结算 Then 拒绝订单（证据：src/checkout/order.py:31）\n- [FR-2 | 集成级] Given 第二张优惠码 When 叠加 Then 拒绝（证据：src/checkout/coupon.py:8）\n\n## 非目标\n不重构结账模块。\n\n## 备注\n\n## 扫描基线\ncommit：abc1234def；日期：2026-10-29；已覆盖：src/checkout/；未覆盖：src/billing/（未覆盖区不得读成不存在）。\nEOF"}], "want": 0, "cmd": "check.sh validate docs/specs/0001-legacy-behavior.md", "cmd_raw": "\"check.sh validate docs/specs/0001-legacy-behavior.md\"", "substr": "通过"},
    {"id": "run-tests.sh:1605", "line": 1605, "kind": "t", "desc": "reconstructed spec 覆盖缺报孤儿 FR", "prelude": [{"kind": "chunk", "line": 1572, "text": "wfile docs/specs/0002-legacy-partial.md <<'EOF'\n---\nid: 0002\nstatus: reconstructed\nneed: 0001\nround: 1\ncreated: 2026-10-29\n---\n# 逆向：结账行为残卷\n\n## 问题陈述\n仅部分行为已取证。\n\n## 方案\n沉淀已取证部分。\n\n## 用户故事\n- 作为新会话 agent，我想读已取证行为\n\n## 实现决策\n同逆向 spec 惯例。\n\n## 测试决策\n证据可回溯抽查。\n\n## 验收场景\n- [FR-1 | 工单级] Given 库存不足 When 结算 Then 拒绝订单（证据：src/checkout/order.py:31）\n\n## 非目标\n未取证行为不入本卷。\n\n## 备注\nEOF"}], "want": 1, "cmd": "check.sh validate docs/specs/0002-legacy-partial.md", "cmd_raw": "\"check.sh validate docs/specs/0002-legacy-partial.md\"", "substr": "孤儿 FR"},
