    {"id": "run-tests.sh:2001", "line": 2001, "kind": "t", "desc": "验收报告发布并落映射（issues/41）", "prelude": [{"kind": "chunk", "line": 1831, "text": "\necho \"== dev-accept 蒸馏清扫出口端到端（夹具模拟序列）==\""}, {"kind": "new_repo", "line": 1833}, {"kind": "chunk", "line": 1834, "text": "wfile docs/needs/0001-checkout.md <<'EOF'\n---\nid: 0001\nstatus: confirmed\ncreated: 2026-10-29\n---\n# 结账流程\n\n## 背景与业务目标\n提高结账转化。\n\n## 干系人与用户\n买家；成功标准：下单转化率不降。\n\n## 系统能力需求\n- FR-1 支持购物车结算\n\n## 场景\n- Given 购物车有商品 When 结算 Then 生成订单\n\n## 假设与风险\n- 假设：优惠码规则稳定（代价高 × 不确定中）\n\n## 范围与非目标\n不含退款。\n\n## 开放问题\n无\nEOF\nwfile docs/specs/0001-checkout.md <<'EOF'\n---\nid: 0001\nstatus: approved\nneed: 0001\nround: 1\ncreated: 2026-10-29\n---\n# 结账规格\n\n## 问题陈述\n买家结算慢。\n\n## 方案\n一键结算。\n\n## 用户故事\n- 作为买家，我想要一键结算，以便更快下单\n\n## 实现决策\n新增 checkout 模块。\n\n## 测试决策\n在 checkout 服务 API 边界测。\n\n## 验收场景\n- [FR-1 | 集成级] Given 订单完成 When 开票 Then 发票到达邮箱\n\n## 非目标\n不退额度。\n\n## 备注\nEOF\nwfile docs/tickets/0001-cart.md <<'EOF'\n---\nid: 0001\ntype: feature\nspec: 0001\nstatus: done\nblocked-by: []\ncreated: 2026-10-29\n---\n# 0001: 购物车结算\n\n**做什么：** 从购物车一键生成订单\n\n**验收标准：**\n- [x] 有商品时结算生成订单（测试：checkout_test）\n\n**Blocked by：** 无\n\n## Progress\n已完成\nEOF\nwfile docs/tickets/0002-coupon.md <<'EOF'\n---\nid: 0002\ntype: feature\nspec: 0001\nstatus: done\nblocked-by: []\ncreated: 2026-10-29\n---\n# 0002: 优惠码\n\n**做什么：** 优惠码应用与金额减免\n\n**验收标准：**\n- [x] 有效优惠码应用后金额正确（测试：coupon_test）\n\n**Blocked by：** 无\n\n## Progress\n已完成\nEOF\nwfile docs/reviews/0001-checkout-review.md <<'EOF'\n---\nid: 0001\nstatus: approved\ntickets: [0001, 0002]\nbranch: feat/checkout\ncreated: 2026-10-29\n---\n# 0001: 结账评审\n\n## 标准轴 findings\n- 无\n\n## Spec 轴 findings\n- 无\n\n## 汇总\n无阻断\nEOF\nwfile docs/acceptance/0001-checkout-round1.md <<'EOF'\n---\nid: 0001\nstatus: passed\nspec: 0001\nround: 1\ncreated: 2026-10-29\n---\n# 0001: 结账验收（round 1）\n\n## 场景结果\n- FR-1 集成级：通过\n\n## 假设验证\n- 假设：优惠码规则稳定——证伪（实际按单计价）\n\n## 残余风险\n- 优惠码叠加上限未定义（影响：对账口径；不阻塞）\n\n## 下一轮建议\n- 定义叠加上限并补对账测试\nEOF\nprintf '# CODING_STANDARDS\\n\\n（索引：docs/standards/）\\n' > \"$TMP/CODING_STANDARDS.md\"\nGITHUB_ADAPTER=\"$HERE/../assets/trackers/github.sh\"\ncp \"$GITHUB_ADAPTER\" \"$TMP/.sdlc/trackers/github.sh\" && chmod +x \"$TMP/.sdlc/trackers/github.sh\"\nsed -i.bak 's/^TRACKER=.*/TRACKER=github/; s/^TRACKER_REPO=.*/TRACKER_REPO=\"acme\\/widget\"/' \"$TMP/.sdlc/config.sh\" && rm -f \"$TMP/.sdlc/config.sh.bak\"\nfake_cmd gh <<'EOF'\n#!/bin/sh\n[ -n \"${FAKE_LOG:-}\" ] && printf '%s\\n' \"$*\" >> \"$FAKE_LOG\"\nif [ \"$1\" = \"auth\" ]; then exit \"${FAKE_AUTH:-0}\"; fi\nif [ \"$1\" = \"issue\" ]; then\n  case \"$2\" in\n    create|edit) ;;\n    *) exit 0 ;;\n  esac\n  prev=\"\"\n  for a in \"$@\"; do\n    if { [ \"$prev\" = \"-F\" ] || [ \"$prev\" = \"--body-file\" ]; } && [ -f \"$a\" ]; then cat \"$a\" >> \"$FAKE_LOG\"; fi\n    prev=\"$a\"\n  done\n  if [ \"$2\" = \"create\" ]; then printf '%s\\n' \"${FAKE_URL:-https://github.com/acme/widget/issues/41}\"; fi\nfi\nexit 0\nEOF"}], "want": 0, "cmd": "PATH=\"$TMP/fakebin:$PATH\" check.sh publish docs/acceptance/0001-checkout-round1.md", "cmd_raw": "\"PATH=\\\"$TMP/fakebin:\\$PATH\\\" check.sh publish docs/acceptance/0001-checkout-round1.md\"", "substr": "投影"},
    {"id": "run-tests.sh:2002", "line": 2002, "kind": "t", "desc": "映射记录已发布对象编号", "prelude": [], "want": 0, "cmd": "grep -q 'docs/acceptance/0001-checkout-round1.md' \"$TMP/.sdlc/trackers/github.map\" && grep -q 'issues/41' \"$TMP/.sdlc/trackers/github.map\"", "cmd_raw": "\"grep -q 'docs/acceptance/0001-checkout-round1.md' \\\"$TMP/.sdlc/trackers/github.map\\\" && grep -q 'issues/41' \\\"$TMP/.sdlc/trackers/github.map\\\"\"", "substr": ""},
    {"id": "run-tests.sh:2031", "line": 2031, "kind": "t", "desc": "蒸馏落点各自 validate 通过（need / spec / ADR）", "prelude": [{"kind": "chunk", "line": 2003, "text": "git -C \"$TMP\" add docs CODING_STANDARDS.md\ngit -C \"$TMP\" commit -qm \"[trivial] 端到端夹具基线\"\nBASE=\"$(git -C \"$TMP\" rev-parse HEAD)\"\n\n# 蒸馏①：need「假设与风险」逐条标注验证结果 + 残余风险与下一轮建议折回\nawk '\n  /^- 假设：优惠码规则稳定/ {\n    print $0 \"（验证：证伪——实际按单计价）\"\n    print \"- 残余风险：优惠码叠加上限未定义（影响：对账口径；不阻塞）\"\n    print \"- 下一轮建议：定义叠加上限并补对账测试（折回自验收报告 0001）\"\n    next\n  }\n  { print }\n' \"$TMP/docs/needs/0001-checkout.md\" > \"$TMP/need.new\" && mv \"$TMP/need.new\" \"$TMP/docs/needs/0001-checkout.md\"\n# 蒸馏②：spec 验收场景按实现中发现的实际边界行为修订\nsed -i.bak 's/Then 发票到达邮箱/\\&（边界修订：附件超限转失败可见）/' \"$TMP/docs/specs/0001-checkout.md\" && rm -f \"$TMP/docs/specs/0001-checkout.md.bak\"\n# 蒸馏③：有架构分量的决策新立 ADR\nwfile docs/adr/0001-atomic-closeout.md <<'EOF'\n---\nid: 0001\nstatus: accepted\ncreated: 2026-10-29\n---\n# 0001: 验收收口为单个原子提交\n蒸馏、清扫、置 done 合并为恰一个 [trivial] 提交，避免门禁中间态。\nEOF\n# 蒸馏④：模式学习追加进 standards\nprintf '%s\\n' \"- 蒸馏清扫出口：先折回再删除（来源：验收 0001）\" >> \"$TMP/CODING_STANDARDS.md\""}], "want": 0, "cmd": "check.sh validate docs/needs/0001-checkout.md && check.sh validate docs/specs/0001-checkout.md && check.sh validate docs/adr/0001-atomic-closeout.md", "cmd_raw": "\"check.sh validate docs/needs/0001-checkout.md && check.sh validate docs/specs/0001-checkout.md && check.sh validate docs/adr/0001-atomic-closeout.md\"", "substr": "通过"},
    {"id": "run-tests.sh:2034", "line": 2034, "kind": "t", "desc": "残留校验活体探针：done 未清扫 validate 必须红", "prelude": [{"kind": "chunk", "line": 2032, "text": "# 残留校验活体探针：spec 先置 done 而未清扫，validate 必须红（校验空转即本用例失败）\nsetfm docs/specs/0001-checkout.md status done"}], "want": 1, "cmd": "check.sh validate docs/specs/0001-checkout.md", "cmd_raw": "\"check.sh validate docs/specs/0001-checkout.md\"", "substr": "docs/tickets/0001"},
    {"id": "run-tests.sh:2041", "line": 2041, "kind": "t", "desc": "置 done 且清扫后全库 validate 通过", "prelude": [{"kind": "chunk", "line": 2035, "text": "setfm docs/specs/0001-checkout.md status approved\n# 清扫：删除该 spec 名下全部过程档（含本次验收报告；tracker 投影不回删）\nrm \"$TMP/docs/tickets/0001-cart.md\" \"$TMP/docs/tickets/0002-coupon.md\" \"$TMP/docs/reviews/0001-checkout-review.md\" \"$TMP/docs/acceptance/0001-checkout-round1.md\"\n# 置 done：spec frontmatter 置 done 并追加 done 日期\nsetfm docs/specs/0001-checkout.md status done\nawk '{print} /^round:/{print \"done: 2026-10-29\"}' \"$TMP/docs/specs/0001-checkout.md\" > \"$TMP/spec.new\" && mv \"$TMP/spec.new\" \"$TMP/docs/specs/0001-checkout.md\""}], "want": 0, "cmd": "for f in docs/needs/*.md docs/specs/*.md docs/adr/*.md; do check.sh validate \"$f\" || exit 9; done", "cmd_raw": "\"for f in docs/needs/*.md docs/specs/*.md docs/adr/*.md; do check.sh validate \\\"\\$f\\\" || exit 9; done\"", "substr": ""},
    {"id": "run-tests.sh:2045", "line": 2045, "kind": "t", "desc": "序列恰产生一个新提交", "prelude": [{"kind": "chunk", "line": 2042, "text": "# 原子提交：蒸馏编辑 + 清扫删除 + 置 done 合为恰一个 [trivial] 提交\ngit -C \"$TMP\" add docs CODING_STANDARDS.md\ngit -C \"$TMP\" commit -qm \"[trivial] 验收收口 spec 0001：蒸馏折回、清扫过程档、置 done\""}], "want": 0, "cmd": "[ \"$(git -C \"$TMP\" rev-list --count $BASE..HEAD)\" = 1 ]", "cmd_raw": "\"[ \\\"\\$(git -C \\\"$TMP\\\" rev-list --count $BASE..HEAD)\\\" = 1 ]\"", "substr": ""},
