    # ── 多仓工作区成员门禁转发（seam 二） ──
    {"id": "run-tests.sh:2150", "line": 2150, "kind": "t", "desc": "成员提交引用根库尚无的工单被拒：转发已生效且校验报不存在", "prelude": [{"kind": "chunk", "line": 2132, "text": "rm -f \"$TMP/.git/hooks/commit-msg\"\n\necho \"== 多仓工作区成员门禁转发（seam 二）==\""}, {"kind": "new_repo", "line": 2135}, {"kind": "chunk", "line": 2136, "text": "mkdir -p \"$TMP/frontend\"\ngit -C \"$TMP/frontend\" init -q -b main\ngit -C \"$TMP/frontend\" config user.email test@example.com\ngit -C \"$TMP/frontend\" config user.name tester\n# 成员转发 hook：照 generation.md「多仓工作区模式」模板逐字落装（复现 setup 的落装行为）；\n# 消息文件须先取绝对路径——git 传给 hook 的是相对成员仓库的路径，锚定到根后原路径失效。\n# $1 成员仓库根，缺省 $TMP/frontend\ninstall_member_hook() {\n  local m=\"${1:-$TMP/frontend}\"\n  printf '#!/bin/sh\\n# sdlc-managed: forward to workspace root .sdlc/check.sh（由 setup-workspace 安装，重装会覆盖本文件）\\nmsg=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"$1\")\" && pwd)/$(basename \"$1\")\"\\ncd \"$(dirname \"$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\")\" && exec ./.sdlc/check.sh commit-msg \"$msg\"\\n' > \"$m/.git/hooks/commit-msg\"\n  chmod +x \"$m/.git/hooks/commit-msg\"\n}\ninstall_member_hook\necho one > \"$TMP/frontend/a.txt\"; git -C \"$TMP/frontend\" add a.txt"}], "want": 1, "cmd": "git -C $TMP/frontend commit -qm '[#0002] x'", "cmd_raw": "\"git -C $TMP/frontend commit -qm '[#0002] x'\"", "substr": "不存在"},
    {"id": "run-tests.sh:2173", "line": 2173, "kind": "t", "desc": "成员提交 [#0002] 放行——工单仅在根 docs/tickets/，即 ROOT 锚定工作区根的证据", "prelude": [{"kind": "chunk", "line": 2151, "text": "wfile docs/tickets/0002-member-gate.md <<'EOF'\n---\nid: 0002\ntype: feature\nspec: 0001\nstatus: in-progress\nblocked-by: []\ncreated: 2026-10-29\n---\n# 0002: 成员门禁夹具工单\n\n**做什么：** 只落工作区仓库根 docs/tickets/，供成员转发校验\n\n**验收标准：**\n- [ ] 夹具（证据：本文件）\n\n**Blocked by：** 无\n\n## Progress\n夹具\nEOF\necho two > \"$TMP/frontend/b.txt\"; git -C \"$TMP/frontend\" add b.txt"}], "want": 0, "cmd": "git -C $TMP/frontend commit -qm '[#0002] y'", "cmd_raw": "\"git -C $TMP/frontend commit -qm '[#0002] y'\"", "substr": "门禁通过"},
    {"id": "run-tests.sh:2217", "line": 2217, "kind": "t", "desc": "成员提交引用 ready 工单拒绝并报原因", "prelude": [{"kind": "chunk", "line": 2174, "text": "wfile docs/tickets/0004-ready-gate.md <<'EOF'\n---\nid: 0004\ntype: feature\nspec: 0001\nstatus: ready\nblocked-by: []\ncreated: 2026-10-29\n---\n# 0004: ready 状态夹具工单\n\n**做什么：** 夹具\n\n**验收标准：**\n- [ ] 夹具（证据：本文件）\n\n**Blocked by：** 无\n\n## Progress\n夹具\nEOF\nwfile docs/tickets/0003-done-gate.md <<'EOF'\n---\nid: 0003\ntype: feature\nspec: 0001\nstatus: done\nblocked-by: []\ncreated: 2026-10-29\n---\n# 0003: done 状态夹具工单\n\n**做什么：** 夹具\n\n**验收标准：**\n- [x] 夹具（证据：本文件）\n\n**Blocked by：** 无\n\n## Progress\n夹具\nEOF\necho three > \"$TMP/frontend/c.txt\"; git -C \"$TMP/frontend\" add c.txt"}], "want": 1, "cmd": "git -C $TMP/frontend commit -qm '[#0004] x'", "cmd_raw": "\"git -C $TMP/frontend commit -qm '[#0004] x'\"", "substr": "先 /dev-implement 开工再提交"},
    {"id": "run-tests.sh:2219", "line": 2219, "kind": "t", "desc": "成员提交引用 done 工单拒绝并指路 fix", "prelude": [{"kind": "chunk", "line": 2218, "text": "echo four > \"$TMP/frontend/d.txt\"; git -C \"$TMP/frontend\" add d.txt"}], "want": 1, "cmd": "git -C $TMP/frontend commit -qm '[#0003] x'", "cmd_raw": "\"git -C $TMP/frontend commit -qm '[#0003] x'\"", "substr": "开新 fix 工单"},
    {"id": "run-tests.sh:2221", "line": 2221, "kind": "t", "desc": "成员提交引用不存在工单拒绝", "prelude": [{"kind": "chunk", "line": 2220, "text": "echo five > \"$TMP/frontend/e.txt\"; git -C \"$TMP/frontend\" add e.txt"}], "want": 1, "cmd": "git -C $TMP/frontend commit -qm '[#9999] x'", "cmd_raw": "\"git -C $TMP/frontend commit -qm '[#9999] x'\"", "substr": "不存在"},
